Exam: 2023.

a) Distinguish between the following topics according to the Penal Code, 1860: [4×2.5=10]
i) Grievous hurt and hurt;
ii) Common intention and common object;
iii) Kidnapping and abduction;
iv) Wrongful restraint and wrongful confinement.

b) X, knowing and intending that it would likely cause death of Y, fires bullet. But it causes death of Z. Under which provision of the Penal Code, 1860 X committed the offence? Explain. [5]
